 dish out cash for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/717-monghani","name":"Monghani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar717_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"358"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T15:26:56-07:00","id":973435,"title":"","content":"Yep, seconded. As much as I would want to see what Acrozatarim had in mind for the Lodge I'd rather read about it in a book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T15:34:48-07:00","id":973438,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Monghani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/973018-lodge-of-death?p=973324#post973324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd rather he get paid to write it and then have preview blogs up sometime before the actual book drops. Gotta show the Devs that the fans want more stuff and are willing to dish out cash for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>What book? There's nothing for Werewolf being worked on, and we're not having books full of lodges anymore. The last brochure didn't even mention anything in the future for Werewolf.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T16:11:51-07:00","id":973464,"title":"","content":"In prior blogs they asked the fanbase for book ideas and what they would like to see so I imagine Werewolf is one of the games they are looking at more ideas for. At the moment Stew Wilson is the Developer for both Forsaken and Apocalypse and the kickstarter for Apocalypse included a ton of goal supplements.<br /> <br /> I didn't say a Lodgebook, I meant in later books they could include Lodges in them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/717-monghani","name":"Monghani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar717_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"358"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T16:21:29-07:00","id":973474,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Monghani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/973018-lodge-of-death?p=973324#post973324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd rather he get paid to write it and then have preview blogs up sometime before the actual book drops. Gotta show the Devs that the fans want more stuff and are willing to dish out cash for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>One doesn't precludes the other. Example: Rose posted the pregnancy rules/conditions before they were featured in Idigam Chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T17:22:35-07:00","id":973515,"title":"","content":"wait theres nothing for werewolf? Like in general or just for forsaken? I was under the impression that apocalypse had 3 books that were nearing release (I thought shattered and changing would have been out months ago but dev times being what they are).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T17:26:39-07:00","id":973518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lyrics Of War</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/973018-lodge-of-death?p=973515#post973515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">wait theres nothing for werewolf? Like in general or just for forsaken? I was under the impression that apocalypse had 3 books that were nearing release (I thought shattered and changing would have been out months ago but dev times being what they are).</div> </div> </div> </div>They mean Forsaken, as should be noted due to the forum in which we're currently posting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T02:57:44-07:00","id":973735,"title":"","content":"If their write something i will read, i really love chronicle of darkness,i really wish to see more lodges, with the pack book i can create new lodges, but i tend to overpower then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5311-thiagocord","name":"Thiagocord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T19:40:05-07:00","id":974823,"title":"","content":"The lodge of death is a weird one technically it has 3 write ups in 1st edition.<br /> <br /> The 1st edition Core which talks about them as uratha who travel to stygian for knowledge or speak to bygone spirits.<br /> <br /> The Lodge The faithfull writte up in which they get told when they will die and get a nice little voodoo dool.<br /> <br /> And the Hunting grounds the rockies write up for Obadiah Pickering, which says lodge members learn to bind ghost to fetish. Which apparently does something more? There is an example in the books of a mirror that has the Obadiah first wife ghost bound to it which allows him to see from the eyes of all women that have lost a son in an area.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T20:02:26-07:00","id":974832,"title":"","content":"The Rage, I believe, has ghost-touched objects, which seem to work similarly to fetishes. From the description I don't recall if they actually had trapped ghosts, or were just the anchors for ghosts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T03:14:19-07:00","id":976442,"title":"","content":"I will work on something similar with my GM, i will create a branch of the lodge, i want something like the &quot;reapers&quot; theme where the adherents will be a instrument of the death or something like that, i imagine a faceless assassin from GOT as inspiration for that,i only gavinha trouble with the sacred prey, hunt the dead things is cool but i think i will focus on the most powerfull undead (power atribute above 5), like the garms with werewolfs, anyone have any idea of better prey?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5311-thiagocord","name":"Thiagocord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T09:24:59-07:00","id":980815,"title":"","content":"I'd need to clean up and amend my Lodge of Death write-up anyway to post it here, and I don't want to do that without Stew's say-so - especially since I don't know what Lodges might be planned for future products at the mo. Still, you can see parts of where my version of the Lodge is going in its mentions in The Pack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}